  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frame support to MyRights country programme in Bosnia-Herzegovina     2011-2012. SHIA is working in cooperation with a number of CSO&apos;s,     which supports people with disabilities. The aim is to contribute to  people with disabilities and their possibilites to improve their      living conditions and to claim their rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramst&#xf6;d till MyRights landprogram i Bosnien-Herzegovina 2013. SHIA    arbetar tillsammans med ett antal CSO&apos;s, som st&#xf6;djer m&#xe4;nniskor med    funktionshinder. Syftet &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja funktionshindrades m&#xf6;jligheter  att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sina levnadsvillkor och att utkr&#xe4;va sina r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
